  "description": "Early Access currently offers about 2.5 hours of gameplay. The final chapter will become available as a free update at full release. \n \n\n Scavenge resources and build your own hideouts, while being hunted. \n\nA curse has placed Radu Castle in peril. Discover and explore every corner of this vast Romanian castle.\n\nDifferent monsters demand different tactics to hide against. Wood burns. Metal breaks. What else is there to discover?\n\nA desperate plea has caused you to return to Radu castle. Face your abuser's hellish wrath. Immerse yourself in a deep story of trauma and survival.\n\nBetween the stalking and hiding, test your wits with light puzzling. Uncover secrets and work yourself out of difficult situations.",
